  "plain": "In 1948, after a flying saucer is said to have come down in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, a man named Ken Farley was hit in the gut with the butt of a gun for talking about it the way he did. Scott Ramsey, a guest who has gathered accounts of the Aztec crash, tells Michels this as something passed on to him about Farley; if true, people who spoke of the crash were silenced by force."
